```

Executing:

```
var cb = em.unwrap(Session.class).getCriteriaBuilder();
JpaCriteriaQuery<Tuple> query = cb.createTupleQuery();
JpaSubQuery<Tuple> subquery = query.subquery(Tuple.class);
JpaRoot<Car> sqRoot = subquery.from(Car.class);

JpaJoin<Car, Vin> vinJoin = sqRoot.join(Car_.vin);
JpaSimpleCase<String, String> vinExpr = cb.<String, String>selectCase(vinJoin.get(Vin_.vin))
        .when("UVdkdk2822", "")
        .otherwise(vinJoin.get(Vin_.vin));
subquery.multiselect(
        sqRoot.get(Car_.id).alias("id"),
        vinExpr.alias("vin")
);
JpaDerivedRoot<Tuple> root = query.from(subquery);
query.select(cb.tuple(
        root.get("id").alias("id"),
        root.get("vin").alias("vin")
)).orderBy(
        cb.asc(root.get("id"))
);

List<Tuple> list = em.createQuery(query).getResultList();
```

The following exception is thrown:

```
java.lang.AssertionError: Expecting tables to match between TableReference (null) and SelectableMapping (public.t_vin)

	at org.hibernate.sql.ast.spi.SqlExpressionResolver.createColumnReferenceKey(SqlExpressionResolver.java:90)
	at org.hibernate.sql.ast.spi.SqlExpressionResolver.resolveSqlExpression(SqlExpressionResolver.java:105)
